#! ia 1.0

@capability method-operate
  meaning
    says "Think and operate under the IA methodology: the method-operate playbook for any work in an IA workspace, and the method-provisional-foundation playbook when the work rests on a spec or decision that is not ratified. It grants no authority; the workspace's mandates decide what the participant may change."
    answers "Which procedure does an agent follow to work under the IA methodology?"
  composition
    playbooks [@playbook method-operate, @playbook method-provisional-foundation]
  execution
    effects [read, local-write]
